sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Attendee
  participant W as Web app
  participant O as 1Click
  participant S as NEAR Intents
  participant U as USDC (NEAR)
  participant B as Bail
  A->>W: RSVP, paying in SOL
  W->>O: quote: exactly 1 USDC to Bail<br/>note in customRecipientMsg<br/>refunds to A on Solana
  O-->>W: deposit address
  A->>O: send SOL from own wallet
  O->>S: swap and deliver
  S->>U: ft_transfer_call<br/>1 USDC with the note
  U->>B: ft_on_transfer(note)
  W->>O: poll status until SUCCESS
  W-->>A: You're in
